    <!--
      No dependencies yet, and no Java.

      Every other module here ships .txt articles beside a hand-written
      catalogue. This one holds .kmd sources under src/main/kmd, which are
      not articles yet: a build step turns them into one JSON resource per
      section beside a generated catalogue, and that step lives in
      kranji-studio rather than here. Until it is wired up, and until the
      reader can serve a generated section, a catalogue in this module would
      name articles nothing can read.

      See README.md.
    -->
